### glxt-api employees_test 存储过程接口测试脚本
### 前置条件：
### 1. 在 Oracle 11g 执行 docs/employees-procedure-test.sql。
### 2. 执行本文件前替换 baseUrl、tenant、token、connectionId。
### 3. 每个 save 请求成功后，把响应 data.id 填到对应 apiId 变量。

@baseUrl = http://10.23.114.39:30480
@tenant = glxt
@token = 替换为接口所在分组token
@systemCode = glxt-proc-test
@connectionId = 替换为Oracle数据源ID

@apiEmpGet = procEmpGet
@apiSalaryDouble = procSalaryDouble
@apiEmpQuery = procEmpQuery
@apiEmpInsert = procEmpInsert
@apiEmpRaiseSalary = procEmpRaiseSalary
@apiEmpMultiCursor = procEmpMultiCursor

@apiEmpGetId = 替换为procEmpGet保存返回data.id
@apiSalaryDoubleId = 替换为procSalaryDouble保存返回data.id
@apiEmpQueryId = 替换为procEmpQuery保存返回data.id
@apiEmpInsertId = 替换为procEmpInsert保存返回data.id
@apiEmpRaiseSalaryId = 替换为procEmpRaiseSalary保存返回data.id
@apiEmpMultiCursorId = 替换为procEmpMultiCursor保存返回data.id


### 1. 保存接口：proc_emp_get，IN + OUT标量
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/interface/save
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant": "{{tenant}}",
  "name": "按员工ID查询员工信息",
  "code": "{{apiEmpGet}}",
  "type": 2,
  "description": "测试IN参数和多个OUT标量参数",
  "orderNo": 101,
  "connectionId": {{connectionId}},
  "fieldBackMode": 1,
  "page": 0,
  "procedureName": "proc_emp_get",
  "apiParamList": [
    {
      "name": "员工ID",
      "code": "empId",
      "type": 2,
      "direction": 1,
      "jdbcType": "DECIMAL",
      "orderNo": 1,
      "required": 1,
      "validateType": 1
    },
    {
      "name": "员工姓名",
      "code": "empName",
      "direction": 2,
      "jdbcType": "VARCHAR",
      "orderNo": 2
    },
    {
      "name": "薪资",
      "code": "salary",
      "direction": 2,
      "jdbcType": "DECIMAL",
      "orderNo": 3
    },
    {
      "name": "部门ID",
      "code": "deptId",
      "direction": 2,
      "jdbcType": "DECIMAL",
      "orderNo": 4
    },
    {
      "name": "状态码",
      "code": "status",
      "direction": 2,
      "jdbcType": "VARCHAR",
      "orderNo": 5
    },
    {
      "name": "状态说明",
      "code": "message",
      "direction": 2,
      "jdbcType": "VARCHAR",
      "orderNo": 6
    }
  ]
}


### 2. 预览：proc_emp_get
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/interface/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": 2,
  "procedureName": "proc_emp_get",
  "apiParamList": [
    {"code": "empId", "direction": 1, "jdbcType": "DECIMAL", "orderNo": 1},
    {"code": "empName", "direction": 2, "jdbcType": "VARCHAR", "orderNo": 2},
    {"code": "salary", "direction": 2, "jdbcType": "DECIMAL", "orderNo": 3},
    {"code": "deptId", "direction": 2, "jdbcType": "DECIMAL", "orderNo": 4},
    {"code": "status", "direction": 2, "jdbcType": "VARCHAR", "orderNo": 5},
    {"code": "message", "direction": 2, "jdbcType": "VARCHAR", "orderNo": 6}
  ]
}


### 3. 执行：proc_emp_get，命中数据
### 预期：outParams.status=0，empName=张三，salary=5000，deptId=10
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/actuator/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant": "{{tenant}}",
  "apiCode": "{{apiEmpGet}}",
  "token": "{{token}}",
  "systemCode": "{{systemCode}}",
  "params": {
    "empId": 1
  }
}


### 4. 执行：proc_emp_get，无数据
### 预期：outParams.status=404，message=employee not found
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/actuator/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant": "{{tenant}}",
  "apiCode": "{{apiEmpGet}}",
  "token": "{{token}}",
  "systemCode": "{{systemCode}}",
  "params": {
    "empId": 999
  }
}


### 5. 执行：proc_emp_get，参数缺失
### 预期：提示必传参数empId不能为空
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/actuator/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenant": "{{tenant}}",
  "apiCode": "{{apiEmpGet}}",
  "token": "{{token}}",
  "systemCode": "{{systemCode}}",
  "params": {}
}


